er tells a tale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/73a3bc7d4dd8ca1354a13360e4919326.poster.avif?t=1751529341\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/73a3bc7d4dd8ca1354a13360e4919326.webm?t=1751529341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/73a3bc7d4dd8ca1354a13360e4919326.mp4?t=1751529341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in this Lovecraftian tale. The locals whisper about the house\u2019s  legacy, while enigmatic visitors appear with peculiar pleas. Engage in dialogs, piece together their fragmented stories, and uncover the fate of those who came before you. But beware\u2014some truths are better left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/f3dceaa6c91fcf2cc2f32e1e20792077.avif?t=1751529341\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/ca4f75e1fa1baebcc7d731a3ff3f3f7f.avif?t=1751529341\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
